 "text": "Hey! How's everything else? Pretty standard. Some years you be the one giving the gift, others the recipient. Check the signage near it, or better, taste a little bit. Okay, I'll be here. The quick test is whether you can see through it from the side. Most people do the front in one go, and the back another day. Twenty for both is rare. Lock from the outside with a ladder so you can reach the lock button. Lock from the outside with a ladder so you can reach the lock button. Then give them quick safety tip about someone trying to push the car off bridge while it's parked.",
